  "question": "Database Business Requirements for Task Management System: This system manages the relationship between users and tasks, including the creation, assignment, and associated files of tasks.  \nUser (User ID, User Name, Full Name, Password, Date of Birth, Avatar File ID, Avatar File Name) records the information of users in the system.  \nTask (Task ID, Task Name, Task Status, Task Priority, Creator User ID, Creation Date, Assignee User ID, Completion Date, Task Remarks) records the detailed information of tasks.  \nTask File (Task File ID, File Name, Task ID) records the information of files associated with tasks.  \nThis system should effectively function in multiple aspects of task management such as task creation, task assignment, and task file association, while maintaining data consistency and integrity.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0326\n\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `user_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `full_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `date_of_birth` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `avatar_file_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `avatar_file_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `task` (\n  `task_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `task_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `task_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `task_priority` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `creator_user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `assignee_user_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `completion_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `task_remarks` varchar(1000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`task_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `task_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`creator_user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `task_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`assignee_user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `task_file` (\n  `task_file_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `file_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `task_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`task_file_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `task_file_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`task_id`) REFERENCES `task` (`task_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
